  "cards": [
    {
      "dot": "emerald",
      "title": "Dispatch path (Phase 2 D, E)",
      "items": [
        "_dispatch builds an AgentContext per request (effective_permission, child_allowed_types) and registers it in the write log before any child runs",
        "_on_dispatch_start persists the agent_dispatch message and chat_agents rows, then broadcasts agent_started on the thread channel",
        "SubAgentRuntime caps concurrency at 8 slots; a dispatching child releases its slot while it waits on its own children",
        "Reports are never truncated: format_dispatch_result returns one entry per child plus workspace_changes",
        "Runtime status changes persist to chat_agents and broadcast agent_status / agent_finished on the thread channel"
      ]
    },
    {
      "dot": "rose",
      "title": "Write guard (Phase 2 A)",
      "items": [
        "BuiltinToolSource read_observer records each read in WorkspaceWriteLog",
        "Check 1 runs in apply; Check 2 runs in accept with no await before promote_files",
        "A stale path raises StaleWriteError naming the writer agent; the loop records ✗ Not applied and continues",
        "Re-seeding every touched file from real on each apply prevents silent lost updates"
      ]
    },
    {
      "dot": "violet",
      "title": "Prompts + gates (1A, 1B)",
      "items": [
        "Engine: create_controller_step(render_ctx, persona, allowed_types) renders the system prompt; main uses RenderContext.main(), children RenderContext.for_agent()",
        "1A: tagged templates render main byte-identical (goldens); children get AGENT role, persona and the report action",
        "1B: pending_controller_gates is a list; decisions select by gate_id (unknown 404, ambiguous 409)",
        "1B: ApprovalOutcome tells the model whether user, policy or timeout denied the call; dontAsk children deny by policy",
        "Phase 2 B: children cannot remember, git-mutate (vcs_refusal) or exceed depth 2"
      ]
    },
    {
      "dot": "amber",
      "title": "Lifecycle (Phase 2 E)",
      "items": [
        "Stop: runtime.stop_agent cancels one child; stopping the turn yields a synthetic dispatch result",
        "Restart: reap_subagents marks orphaned agents and removes their child gates",
        "Rewind: deletes rewound children, their memory segments and their write-log entries"
      ]
    }
  ]
